      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Report on a case with disturbance of the cardiac rhythm (atrioventricular dissociation with ventricular extrasystoles) in connection with a dipyridamol test which regressed under therapy with euphyllin. This observation supports the demand of a continuous control of the ECG when the test is performed."},
